          "310010102": {
            "id": "310010102",
            "speakerId": 2002,
            "speakerName": "Yong'an",
            "text": "Come to think of it, I saw a girl trying to give them some milk while I was on morning patrol...ACHOO!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "310010103"
            ]
          },
          "310010103": {
            "id": "310010103",
            "speakerId": 2002,
            "speakerName": "Yong'an",
            "text": "Thank goodness I was able to stop her. Well, not that she meant them any ill, but cats will get upset stomachs from drinking milk!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "310010104"
            ]
          },
          "310010104": {
            "id": "310010104",
            "speakerId": 2002,
            "speakerName": "Yong'an",
            "text": "...Maybe it's because I've been around cats for so long, but I've also stopped liking milk myself. Here, you take them...ACHOO!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
